    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Not known to Liebermann">
        <head>Ymb Æwbricas Not known to Liebermann</head>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And on your question about adulterers, whether with nuns or lay women, the forfeited woman and man go respectively to the bishopric with her third, and to the lord – whether it be bookland or folkland, whether of the king himself or of any man – he goes with his two parts to his lord if he has wicked intercourse, and they are both forfeit.</ab>
      </div>
